          {
            "title": "Instances",
            "id": 89348,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat kita membuat variabel dari template class, kita sedang membuat <strong>instance</strong>. <code>fluffy</code> dan <code>benny</code> adalah instance dari class <code>VirtualPet</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"fluffy = VirtualPet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"benny = VirtualPet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"79\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>benny</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>VirtualPet()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat kita membuat variabel dari template class, kita sedang membuat <strong>instance</strong>. <code>fluffy</code> dan <code>benny</code> adalah instance dari class <code>VirtualPet</code>.</p><p>Tambahkan instance kedua bernama <code>benny</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"fluffy = VirtualPet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"benny = VirtualPet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"fluffy\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"VirtualPet[]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>benny</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>VirtualPet()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Definition",
            "id": 88762,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kelas <code>VirtualPet</code> yang kita gunakan untuk membuat variabel <code>fluffy</code> disebut <strong>definisi</strong>. <code>VirtualPet</code> adalah definisinya, sedangkan <code>fluffy</code> adalah sebuah instance.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  legs = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  lives = \" /><text value=\"&quot;9&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"fluffy = VirtualPet()\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Variable",
            "id": 88764,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk mengakses variabel class, tambahkan nama instance, <code>.</code>, dan nama variabel yang kamu inginkan, seperti <code>skippy.wagging_tail</code> di sini.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  wagging_tail = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"skippy = VirtualPet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(skippy.wagging_tail)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"106\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>skippy</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, dan terakhir <code>wagging_tail</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk mengakses variabel class, tambahkan nama instance, <code>.</code>, dan nama variabel yang diinginkan.</p><p>Gunakan instance <code>skippy</code> untuk membaca status ekornya dan menampilkan <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  wagging_tail = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"skippy = VirtualPet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(skippy.wagging_tail)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"color\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"VirtualPet\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>skippy</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, dan terakhir <code>wagging_tail</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
