          {
            "title": "Other instances",
            "id": 89039,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat mengakses semua variabel yang kita buat dalam definisi class. Kita mengakses nilai variabel <code>color</code> dengan menulis kode <code>skippy.color</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  wagging_tail = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"skippy = VirtualPet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(skippy.wagging_tail)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(skippy.color)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"114\" endIndex=\"126\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"brown\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>skippy.color</code>.</p></body></html>"
