            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Di dalam pernyataan <code>print()</code>, tampilkan variabel <code>wagging_tail</code> dari instance <code>spot</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  wagging_tail = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"spot = VirtualPet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(spot.wagging_tail)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>spot</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, dan terakhir <code>wagging_tail</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Di dalam pernyataan <code>print()</code>, tampilkan variabel <code>wagging_tail</code> dari instance <code>spot</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  wagging_tail = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"spot = VirtualPet()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(spot.wagging_tail)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>spot</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, dan terakhir <code>wagging_tail</code>.</p></body></html>"
