            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat instance dari class <code>Pokemon</code> dan simpan dalam variabel bernama <code>pokemon</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Pokemon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;squirtle&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pokemon = Pokemon()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(pokemon.name)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"squirtle\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>pokemon</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, lalu <code>Pokemon</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
